    "description": "General-purpose key-value configuration center, stored in the <code>account_meta.system_config</code> table. Any change is immediately fanned out to all alive instances; a 60s fallback tick also syncs automatically. Value must be valid JSON (strings like <code>\"abc\"</code>, numbers like <code>123</code>, objects like <code>{\"a\":1}</code>).",
